cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite the versioned software release."
title: "Genuine Zero Uniform Atlas Energy"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Massensini
    given-names: Thiago
license: MIT
version: 0.11.0
date-released: 2026-08-17
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the native real-camera/Genuine zero identity, the
  faithful C2--C7 cutoff operator, sharp critical cutoff-tail and raw-energy
  asymptotics, and exact logarithmic cutoff jets. Version 0.11.0 proves that
  the concrete finite six-camera raw energy converges pointwise to its infinite
  empirical energy, proves that a Genuine zero annihilates that limit energy,
  and packages regional, strip-wide, and global confinement consequences from
  an eventual positive finite coercivity certificate. The certificate itself
  remains a separate quantitative hypothesis; floating-point evidence is not
  imported into the kernel.
keywords:
